<title>UK: Halifax indicated at 776p in pre-market.</title>
<headline>Halifax indicated at 776p in pre-market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's biggest mortgage lender, the Halifax Building Society Plc was indicated at 776p on Monday, its first day of trading on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The London share market officially opens at 0730 GMT.</p>
<p>--Dale Faulken, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
